## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design augmented data structures balancing prefix queries and order-statistics on strings, common in autocomplete and search systems at scale.

## Key Concepts

- Trie augmentation with subtree sums for prefix sums
- AVL trees for lexicographic ordering of terminal words
- Complexity trade-offs between O(|word| log n) updates vs O(|prefix|) prefix queries
- Optional segment-tree mapping words to indices for range-sum queries

